<title>USA: Bolivia buys 23,250 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat.</title>
<headline>Bolivia buys 23,250 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia bought 23,250 tonnes U.S. No.2 or better U.S. hard red winter wheat under PL 480, Title I, set for October 1-25 delivery, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Cargill Inc at $173.19 a tonne, FOB, U.S. west coast.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
